    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The \"purge\" aspect is concerning. I need to verify the scale of these \"data voids\" to see if they are targeting specific sectors. \n\nCan you identify a specific, recent instance where a high-influence digital presence—perhaps a major news event, a public figure's social media history, or a significant digital archive—has shown signs of this \"ghosting\" or sudden de-indexing? I need a concrete example of the erasure in action.",
